    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Discover the perfect blend of privacy, convenience, and spacious modern living in this well presented 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom semi-detached home. Tucked away in the highly sought-after, quiet residential enclave of Colliers Brook off the Clonminch Road, this property is presented in move-in condition. It offers a bright, airy, and exceptionally versatile layout across two levels, making it an ideal choice for growing families, first-time buyers, or downsizers alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway:\t6.73m x 1.84m  Tile floor, featuring bright, neutral tones\r\n\r\nGuest WC:  1.42m x 1.45m  Tile floor, WHB & WC\r\n\r\nLiving Room:3.18m x 5.41m  A bright, expansive family living space designed for comfort and modern entertainment. Feature fireplace, wood floor\r\n\r\nOpen plan Kitchen/ Dining: 5.10m x 4.m  Fitted kitchen with tile surround. Tile floor.  Patio doors to garden.\r\n\r\nUtility:  1.57m x 1.47m.  Plumbed for washer/dryer.  Tile floor.  Door to side.  \r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs & landing with Hotpress off.\r\n\r\nBedroom One(Master):   2.01m x 2.97m.  Carpet floor.   Fitted wardrobes.  Ensuite off.  Overlooking rear garden  \r\nEnsuite:\t2.67m x 1.19m.  Fully tiled, pump shower, WC & WHB.  \r\n\r\nBedroom Two:  3.m x 4.5m.  Carpet floor.   Fitted wardrobes.  \r\n\r\nBedroom Three:   5.11m x 3.51m.  Carpet floor.   Fitted wardrobes.  \r\n\r\nBathroom:\t  2.67m x 1.8m.  Fully tiled, pump shower, WC & WHB"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious Living: Layout designed to maximize natural light.\r\nPremium Parking: Large private front driveway finished with a premium paved cobble-lock surface, providing dedicated parking for 2 vehicles.\r\nSun Drenched Garden: Highly desirable south-facing rear garden.\r\nPrime Location: Peaceful community atmosphere situated just a short stroll from the heart of Tullamore town centre.\r\nCommuter Friendly: Quick, convenient walking distance to Tullamore Railway Station with direct links to Dublin and Galway\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet, well-maintained community, you are just a short stroll from Tullamore town centre, the railway station, and local amenities like shops, cafes, and scenic walking trails.\r\nA Short Stroll: To the Tullamore Court Hotel with its spa, swimming pool and gym.\r\nCommuter Friendly: Easy walking distance to Tullamore Railway Station, connecting you to Dublin and Galway.\r\nTown Centre Vibrancy: Shops, cafes, and restaurants are just a short walk away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
